graph TD
    start((Start)) --> works{Does it work?}
    works -- Yes --> keep[Don't touch it]
    works -- No --> touched{Did you touch it?}
    touched -- Yes --> idiot[You fool!]
    touched -- No --> hide{Will anyone know?}
    idiot --> blame{Can you blame<br/>someone else?}
    blame -- Yes --> fine([No problem])
    blame -- No --> doomed[/You're doomed\]
    hide -- Yes --> trash[(Hide it)]
    hide -- No --> doomed
    doomed --> retry[Try again]
    retry --> works
    keep --> fine
    trash --> fine
